  "observations": [
    "FUN_006a4b40 passes NODE record +0x1c directly to FUN_0069bc50; the dword at +0x1c is the first object-payload word, not an object-payload offset.",
    "NODE and object string/resource offsets are relative to the complete SGB base, including the payload arena after the END chunk.",
    "The retail dispatcher recognizes LOD in addition to HIERARCHY, OBJECT and DAMAGE.",
    "Binary bytes +0x22/+0x23 match the XML fields matrices/subobjects; they are not hierarchy type/count.",
